ive considering she's  been built up as a good character for  the last two movies it would kind of be  like if Luke turned dark and returned to  the Jedi going back to JJ whose force  awakens was criticized for following the  same story structure of a new hole  the second theory is that Rey is  pretending to join the dark side much  like how Luke came to Vader in Return of  the Jedi donning his black sethe outfit  Rey pretending to go dark maybe what she  needs to do in order to gain access to  Palpatine or some other person or thing  finally we have the darkest timeline Rey  actually goes dark I previously  mentioned that having her go to the dark  side too quickly could result in some  problems kind of like how Daenerys going  to dark in Game of Thrones well let's  not get into that there's one key piece  of information about race past we still  need clarity on her real parents  jump treasures so do you want for  drinking money the final theory is a bit  of a doozy so hang tight in the Darth  Vader comic volume 25 we learned that  Palpatine was able to manipulate the  midi-chlorians inside Shmi Skywalker and  thus was able to make life within her  that would make Palpatine Anakin's  father a skill he likely learned from  Darth Plagueis who was obsessed with  immortality if Palpatine is somehow  raised father having manipulated a  woman's midi-chlorians it would  technically make her a brother to Vader  or at least a half-brother since me was  killed in attack of the clones but how  this revelation would turn her full  darkside is still yet to be known let's  not also forget that the original  beginning of the force awakens was  supposed to start with Luke's severed  hand floating in space gripping his  lightsaber but it was later cut from the  edit one theory is that this hand was  picked up and used to create clones of  the quote-unquote chosen one is there  any relation to that and to Rey then  there's some more info we can glean from  the images of Darkrai hers